.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-webhook-create - Create a webhook (secret returned once)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro webhook create [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a webhook (secret returned once)

.PP
Deliveries are \fBPOST\fR JSON with headers \fBX-Gyro-Event\fR, \fBX-Gyro-Delivery\fR, \fBX-Gyro-Timestamp\fR and \fBX-Gyro-Signature: sha256=HMAC_SHA256(secret, timestamp + "." + body)\fR (white-label resellers: \fBX-Webhook-*\fR). Reject requests whose timestamp is older than 5 minutes. Retries: exponential back-off, 8 attempts; 20 consecutive failures disable the webhook.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/webhooks (operationId createWebhook, scope webhooks)


